# Swagger UI is vendored into here by `prebuild`, inside the builder stage.
# Copying a developer's working copy in first would put whatever happens to be
# on their disk into the build context, when the version the lockfile pins is
# the one that should ship.
public/docs/
# Nothing below is read by the build. Kept out of the context so that a
# change to the docs, the CI or the deploy scripts leaves the build fully
# cached and the images identical, instead of recompiling the app.
